sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant DB
    
    User->>Frontend: Enters Email & Password
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: Fetch User by Email
    DB-->>API: Returns User Hash
    
    alt Password Invalid
        API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
        Frontend-->>User: Show Error
    else Password Valid
        API->>API: Generate JWT Payload
        API->>API: Generate CSRF Token
        API-->>Frontend: Set-Cookie: access_token (HttpOnly)
        API-->>Frontend: Return JSON { "csrf_token": "...", "user": {...} }
    end
    
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store CSRF token in AuthContext
    Frontend-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard
    
    Note over Frontend, API: Subsequent API Requests
    Frontend->>API: Request + Cookie + X-CSRF-Token
    API->>API: Validate JWT
    API->>API: Validate CSRF match
    API->>API: Check RBAC Roles
    alt Valid
        API-->>Frontend: Success Response
    else Invalid
        API-->>Frontend: 401/403 Error
    end
